Upon activation summon a Temporal Hound.  Every [53, 34, 26, 21, 18 (TL1-5)] turns another hound will be summoned, up to a maximum of three hounds. If a hound dies you'll summon a new hound in [53, 34, 26, 21, 18 (TL1-5)] turns.

Your hounds inherit your increased damage percent, have [5%, 11%, 15%, 19%, 21% (TL1-5)] physical resistance and [20%, 46%, 63%, 77%, 87% (TL1-5)] temporal resistance, and are immune to teleportation effects.

Hounds will get, [62, 78, 89, 99, 107 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] Strength, [62, 78, 89, 99, 107 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] Dexterity, [62, 78, 89, 99, 107 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] Constitution, [62, 78, 89, 99, 107 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] Magic, [62, 78, 89, 99, 107 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] Willpower, and [62, 78, 89, 99, 107 (TL1-5; MAG 100)] Cunning, based on your Magic stat.
